message: "If you use this research package, please cite it as below."
title: "WRRA-Motor H2: From Minimal State Transitions to a Candidate Walking Protein and DNA"
type: software
version: "0.4"
date-released: 2026-09-08
authors:
  - family-names: Choi
    given-names: Wonsik
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4263-9772"
