  - protein design
  - kinesin
  - molecular motor
  - sequence design
  - DNA reverse translation
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  A reproducible WRRA Core 1.0 application that derives a strict two-contact
  walking architecture and maps it to H2-b2f820d18e, a 385-aa hybrid candidate
  comprising KIF5B residues 1-353 and a designed 32-aa gate. The package emits
  a 1,158-nt candidate CDS, provenance ledgers, deterministic renderer outputs,
  and explicit falsification conditions. Physical walking remains open.

